Package: libgdm-dev
Version: @DEB_LIBGDM_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Development
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gdm
Depends: libgdm1 (= @DEB_LIBGDM_V@), libglib2.0-dev
Description: GNOME Display Manager (client library development files)
 Headers, pkg-config file and the unversioned dylib symlink for libgdm1.
 Required on-device to generate the Gdm-1.0 gir/typelib that gnome-shell
 imports at boot.
